{"name":"get_arm_profile","title":"Get Arm Profile","description":"Get one arm profile by id (filters GET /v1/arm-profiles; no GET-by-id exists upstream).

Returns: the arm profile object, verbatim. To change it, pass only the fields to change as
`settings` to update_arm_profile (a partial PATCH). An id the list does not carry fails,
listing every valid arm_profile_id.

Example call (get_arm_profile):
    {"host": "my-console", "arm_profile_id": "00000000000000000000010b"}

On a console in global Alarm Manager mode the arm-profile reads answer HTTP 400;
check get_protect_alarm_manager_mode. On Protect 7.4.96 or later the external arm-profile
tools (list_external_arm_profiles and the rest) serve a global-mode console.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"host":{"type":"string","description":"Console name (case-insensitive reportedState.hostname/name, e.g. "my-console") or data[].id (MAC:numericId), from list_hosts. Serves Network and Protect."},"arm_profile_id":{"type":"string","description":"Protect arm profile id. Get it from list_arm_profiles (id). Protect id
